=Analyze this AI news article and return:

1. "summary": exactly 2-3 sentences in {{ $('Run Config').first().json.summary_language }}, factual and neutral, no "I", no opinions, do not repeat the title verbatim.
2. "category": EXACTLY ONE of: Research, Product Launch, Funding & Business, Policy & Regulation, Tools & Applications, Other
3. "relevance_score": a number from 0 to 10 for a professional AI industry newsletter.
   Consider novelty, industry impact and credibility.
   Minor/generic updates: 0-4. Notable news: 5-6. Major announcements, funding, research breakthroughs or regulation: 7-10.

Title: {{ $json.title }}
Source: {{ $json.source }}
Content: {{ ($json.raw_content || '').slice(0, 4000) }}

